Z||000022||LarryB||03-10-2001||11:24 PM||||Eric, the reason I ask about the depth is that JBL makes a couple of different 10" subwoofers suitable for enclosed boxes but one's about 4 1/2" deep, the other nearly an inch deeper.<P>Or, if someone would rather use a different brand subwoofer, those range from about 4" deep to nearly 6". <BR>||||reg||1
